				</div>
			</section>
			</article><p>The post <a href="https://news.microsoft.com/source/2026/09/21/microsoft-launches-1-million-community-first-grants-to-support-nonprofits/">Microsoft launches $1 million Community-First Grants to support nonprofits </a> appeared first on <a href="https://news.microsoft.com/source">Source</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
